    "stdout": "T013 : ∀ (n : ℕ) (E : Set (YEucl n)),\n  (∀ (m : ℕ) (x y : YEucl m) (t u : ℝ), dist (YJoin x t) (YJoin y u) = √(dist x y ^ 2 + |t - u| ^ 2)) ∧\n      (∀ (m : ℕ) (z : YEucl (m + 1)), YJoin (YBase z) (YLast z) = z) ∧\n        (∀ (m : ℕ) (x : YEucl m) (t : ℝ), YBase (YJoin x t) = x ∧ YLast (YJoin x t) = t) ∧\n          (∀ (m : ℕ), LipschitzWith 1 YBase ∧ LipschitzWith 1 YLast) ∧ Isometry YLine ∧ Function.Surjective YLine →\n    (1 ≤ n →\n        ∀ (q : ℝ),\n          0 < q →\n            dimH E < ENNReal.ofReal q →\n              ∀ (r : ℝ),\n                0 < r →\n                  r ≤ 1 →\n                    ∀ (ε : ℝ),\n                      0 < ε →\n                        ∃ U,\n                          YCover r E U ∧\n                            (∀ (i : ℕ), (U i).Nonempty → 0 < Metric.ediam (U i)) ∧ YCost q U < ENNReal.ofReal ε) →\n      1 ≤ n →\n        ∀ (q : ℝ),\n          0 < q →\n            dimH E < ENNReal.ofReal q →\n              ∀ (r : ℝ),\n                0 < r →\n                  r ≤ 1 →\n                    ∀ (ε : ℝ),\n                      0 < ε → ∃ V, YCover (√2 * r) (YF E) V ∧ YCost (q + 1) V < ENNReal.ofReal (2 * √2 ^ (q + 1) * ε)\n'Translation.T013' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n",
